33
00:01:29.833 --> 00:01:30.866
Kind of.

34
00:01:32.233 --> 00:01:35.000
Whatever. Let's go and show them what we're made of.

35
00:01:35.066 --> 00:01:37.966
- Of course, and I'm gonna win.
- Of course, and I'm gonna win.

36
00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:38.866
