70
00:03:35.466 --> 00:03:36.533
Serena.

71
00:03:36.966 --> 00:03:40.400
Tomorrow, I'll give it my all. It's time to go for broke.

72
00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.633
- Great. See you soon.
- Mm-hm.

73
00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:55.333
The opening of the Gloire City Pokémon Showcase Master Class

74
00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.366
