76
00:04:06.766 --> 00:04:07.833
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

77
00:04:07.900 --> 00:04:09.600
- Hey, Braixen?
- Brai?

78
00:04:12.433 --> 00:04:14.666
This is finally it, win or lose.

79
00:04:15.533 --> 00:04:17.833
We gotta give it everything we've got.

80
00:04:17.899 --> 00:04:18.966
- Braixen.
- Pancham.

81
00:04:19.766 --> 00:04:20.733
Here goes.

82
00:04:21.166 --> 00:04:22.466
- Braix.
- Cham.

83
00:04:23.933 --> 00:04:27.700
Ready, set, go!

84
00:04:27.766 --> 00:04:33.433
No doubt Serena's teamwork is amazing, but we'll show them what we've got, too.

85
00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:35.866
- What do you say, Ivysaur?
- Saur.

86
00:04:38.900 --> 00:04:40.266
Smoo.

87
00:04:44.433 --> 00:04:48.000
None of that means a thing because who will be Kalos Queen?

88
00:04:48.066 --> 00:04:51.300
- Why, it's me.
- We'll show them who's top of the heap.

89
00:04:51.366 --> 00:04:53.933
- Gourgeist.
- Wobbuffet.

90
00:05:13.033 --> 00:05:16.133
If Jessie wins, we can return to our life of crime.

91
00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:17.933
What a crowd. Wow.

92
00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Well, this is the Master Class.

93
00:05:20.166 --> 00:05:21.900
This is what it's all about.

94
00:05:22.366 --> 00:05:24.100
