95
00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.633
Serena, you'll be great.

96
00:05:31.933 --> 00:05:35.100
Bonjour, Pokémon lovers, and welcome.

97
00:05:35.166 --> 00:05:36.966
The hour is here.

98
00:05:37.033 --> 00:05:40.200
We're now at the moment you've been waiting for.

99
00:05:41.766 --> 00:05:45.600
It's the Gloire City Pokémon Showcase Master Class.

100
00:05:47.233 --> 00:05:48.733
And it's about to begin.

101
00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:58.433
Please allow me to introduce myself.

102
00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.900
- I'm Pierre, your host.
- Klefki.

103
00:06:00.966 --> 00:06:04.333
Now, would you please turn your attention to the stage?

104
00:06:07.233 --> 00:06:11.000
Prepare to meet our beautiful and talented performers.

105
00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.400
And now, ladies, if you please,

106
00:06:15.466 --> 00:06:18.900
