107
00:06:18.966 --> 00:06:24.266
place them into the three locks and watch as the door to your future opens.

108
00:06:33.133 --> 00:06:38.733
My first key. It represents the win that marked the beginning of my quest.

109
00:06:39.733 --> 00:06:41.333
The search for my dreams.

110
00:06:47.866 --> 00:06:49.433
My second key.

111
00:06:49.500 --> 00:06:53.933
Showing me that my dream was one step closer to becoming a reality.

112
00:07:04.066 --> 00:07:05.133
My third key.

113
00:07:05.733 --> 00:07:11.433
Yes, we had some rough moments winning it, but we overcame them together.

114
00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:18.666
And now, I'm here,

115
00:07:19.166 --> 00:07:21.966
and I will become Kalos Queen.

116
00:07:34.000 --> 00:07:35.433
Serena!

117
00:07:50.566 --> 00:07:55.966
It's my pleasure to introduce you to our very special guest.

118
00:07:58.066 --> 00:07:59.666
- Who's that?
- Pika?

119
00:07:59.733 --> 00:08:02.466
Former Kalos Queen and well-known producer,

120
00:08:02.533 --> 00:08:06.300
