121
00:08:06.366 --> 00:08:07.733
Welcome, Palermo.

122
00:08:08.733 --> 00:08:11.733
She's agreed to take on the role of special judge.

123
00:08:12.133 --> 00:08:13.466
Huh? I know her.

124
00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:17.233
There's something you lack to be Kalos Queen.

125
00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.633
Until you know what that is, you'll never be able to defeat Aria.

126
00:08:25.366 --> 00:08:30.533
I'm very much looking forward to observing everyone's wonderful performances today.

127
00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.600
Good luck to all of you.

128
00:08:35.100 --> 00:08:37.966
Thank you. It's a pleasure to have you here.

129
00:08:38.266 --> 00:08:39.433
All right then,

130
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:43.466
