147
00:10:13.400 --> 00:10:15.933
Now it's time to explain the rules.

148
00:10:16.033 --> 00:10:19.766
Here at our Master Class, there is no Theme Performance.

149
00:10:19.833 --> 00:10:23.133
It consists of Freestyle Performances only.

150
00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.400
What's up with that?

151
00:10:24.466 --> 00:10:28.300
