157
00:10:48.766 --> 00:10:53.600
The first and second rounds will feature the performer and a single Pokémon.

158
00:10:53.766 --> 00:10:57.766
The semi-finals will feature the performer and two Pokémon.

159
00:10:58.233 --> 00:11:01.433
Finally, the performer who wins the semi-finals

160
00:11:01.533 --> 00:11:04.200
