181
00:12:27.766 --> 00:12:29.400
Chum!

182
00:12:29.833 --> 00:12:31.033
- Smoochum.
- Ha, ha.

183
00:12:32.933 --> 00:12:34.566
Chum!

184
00:12:34.633 --> 00:12:36.200
Smoochum!

185
00:12:36.666 --> 00:12:39.766
- Smoochum!
- Ha-ha-ha.

186
00:12:40.366 --> 00:12:41.733
