195
00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:12.500
- Powder Snow.
- Smoochum!

196
00:13:13.300 --> 00:13:15.800
- Scraggy, Focus Blast.
- Scraggy!

197
00:13:15.866 --> 00:13:18.600
